a-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t4-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> effect on academic scores.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Recommendations</strong><ul><li>Parents ought to take notice of teenagers' IM usage and offer suitable <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t4-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and control their use of IM.</li></ul></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ielts-simulation-tests-academic-listening-test-4-3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t4-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3221121-ielts-simulation-tests-academic-listening-test-4-4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t4-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-32","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Write NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS for each answer.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong> Where are the British Isles situated?\nIn the</span><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t4-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong> The Venn di